	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"&dHello! The 1.20.1 port of this modpack is a work in progress and is in a beta state. Please report any bugs you encounter on the Finality Genesis GitHub Issues page or through our Discord, thank you!&r"
				""
				"Notice: If you randomly hear music throughout the world, assume that a mob spawned in with a &bSophisticated Backpack&r with the music upgrade."
				""
				"If you wish to play the modpack on its intended difficulty, set the difficulty to &cHard&r. For obvious reasons, this is entirely optional."
				""
				"Quests on this chapter are also not expected to be completed on the first few Minecraft days."
				""
				"The rest of the chapters can be accessed after you click the &acheckmark&r here and move your cursor to the left edge of your screen."
				""
				"If you are playing with friends, please do not forget to make a party with &aFTB Teams&r! Press &dE&r to open your inventory and look for three person figures on the top left corner."
				""
				"Next page!"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Press &bX&r to crawl."
				""
				"Press &eY&r while your cursor is hovering over an item to find that same item in a nearby chest. White particles will show up inside of it through the walls."
				""
				"Also, take the time now to SET YOUR KEYBINDS and adjust volume levels if needed."
				""
				"This modpack is not complete and development is ongoing, but the end goal is &6reachable&r."
				""
				"Tips for using &l&7REI&r are on the next few pages in addition to &eLootr&r chest info. Just don't say I didn't warn you if your Lootr chest blows up."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&l&7Roughly Enough Items&r &l&aTips and Tricks&r"
				""
				"There's a lot of things to unpack here. Don't forget to scroll!"
				""
				"- &aLeft clicking&r items shows how to get them, with all the methods shown at the top of the recipe viewing window where all those tabs are."
				""
				"- &3Right clicking&r items shows all the recipes that the item is used in."
				""
				"- &l&9Fluids&r&r in the recipe viewing area can be &bleft clicked&r to find out how to make them. This especially applies to filling by Create's Spout recipes."
				""
				"- Press &dCtrl + F&r to focus the search bar then start typing. "
				""
				"- If you want to clear the search bar instantly, do &aCtrl + F&r then &cCtrl + A&r to select all the text before finally pressing &cBackspace&r to clear all of the selected text."
				""
				"- To search by mod, use &d@&r then type the modid of that mod. Examples: &d@create&r or &d@createaddition&r or &d@extendedcrafting&r"
				""
				"- To search by tags, use &e#&r then type the item tag you want to look up. Examples: &e#wood&r or &e#planks&r"
				""
				"Addtional REI information can be found on the next page."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Sometimes, Create's Sequenced Assembly recipe type or other recipes may fail to be visible. To fix this, go to REI's Settings by clicking the little cogwheel next to the search bar and click &l&bMore Options...&r."
				""
				"From there, look at the left hand side and look for a settings category labelled &l&eReload \\& Reset&r and click &l&cReload Plugins&r. Try left clicking on the Precision Mechanism or another item that uses Sequenced Assembly and it should be displaying as normal."
				""
				"&l&eLootr&r info is on the next page."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&l&eLootr&r chests provide a unique instance of loot for each player, so what your friends get can be different from what you get. It is common courtesy not to break them."
				""
				"- Lootr Chests DO NOT say if they are a trapped chest or not, even with Jade. What does this mean for you?"
				""
				"&l&c<shake>Check for TNT or redstone around each Lootr chest.</shake>&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Thinking of no longer using Patchouli for the guide book... information below is not relevant until it is more up to date."
				""
				"-+-"
				""
				"If you lose the &5Tome of Finality&r, it is reclaimable from Emergency Items (broken heart icon) on the right. You can also craft the guidebook with two sticks!"
				""
				"However, the book is not finished and won't be for a while. There is some info that isn't present in FTB Quests, however."
			]
			icon: "kubejs:brass_singularity"
			id: "4A691BB889286C89"
