		{
			dependencies: ["650B5FD6B6CAD69C"]
			description: [
				"Throughout the world, you may find incomplete boats. These serve as templates."
				""
				"If you are too lazy to explore the world, you can also use the included schematics, once you have made an Empty Schematic from Create."
				""
				"You will need to complete these templates in a symmetrical manner with components and planks."
				""
				"Eventually, the boat scaffolding blocks will disappear and a blue hammer hologram will appear in certain places with the materials you need to put in."
				""
				"Unfortunately, you can't make your own boats."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Certain blocks are tagged with an item tag called &d\"alekiships:can_place_in_compartments\"&r which allows you to place blocks into the ship."
